 *    It greatly improves data locality:
 *      - the innermost loop runs over j, and B is laid out with j contiguous,
 *        so both B[i,*] and B[k,*] are streamed with unit stride;
 *      - A[k,i] is loaded once per (i,k) and reused across all j.
 *
